    - Port with round-14 and null adapters, fake world by host, DSL, runner with `--parallel` and
      falsify;
    - oracles three-channels, attempt-identity, one-delivery, lane-cells;
    - suite 61/61, null 0/61, falsify 25/25, `nub run check` at zero.

    **Unreviewed:** `3097ea3c` and `bc8dffba`, the run's first cadence review.

    **Work list:** the README's guarantee map and items 1 to 9.
